WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.067
The customer copy: A4 invoices and proposals.

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:07.867
Open an invoice. Click any invoice.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:23.400
What the customer gets. The invoice exactly as it's printed and emailed: A4 pages, with the invoice total, what's paid, what's due and when it was issued across the top. The account balance stays in its own box at the bottom.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.700
Open full size. The pages at real size.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:39.967
Print or PDF. Print it, or choose Save as PDF in the print window to attach it to an email. Proposals work the same way, from the estimate's Customer copy card.

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:46.067
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
